# Acting in Good Faith (windurst 64): 10019's finish at an option neither 0 nor 1. The Lua begins the quest on option 0
# only (Acting_in_Good_Faith.lua:41): option 2 gives nothing (a test of option != 1 would begin it). Then option 0.
lists WindurstWaters/Gantineux/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/10019
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-83.5,-9.25,3.5 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Windurst 225
login
trigger Gantineux                             # 10019
finish option=2                               # not 0: nothing, still available
trigger Gantineux                             # 10019
finish option=0                               # the Spirit Incense; begun
